	<Folder id="5DB05C621D000001">
		<name>Chattogram Port — Drone Operating Area &amp; Exclusion Zones (3D)</name>
		<open>1</open>
		<description>Converted from Drone_Operating_area_with_exclusion_zones.geojson.
Open in Google Earth (desktop or earth.google.com) with 3D terrain / photorealistic buildings enabled.
Includes flat reference zones, stylized 3D exclusion &quot;domes&quot; over restricted airspace (built from each
zone&apos;s own footprint, tapering to an apex — not an exact vertical regulatory boundary), a 3D barrier wall
along the restricted riverfront perimeter, and a simple procedural quadcopter model hovering at each
drone dock at an illustrative 120 m AGL patrol altitude.</description>
